Hi,

I've been looking for replacement batteries for my multia's

for quite a while ( I live in Holland) and found a perfect solution:

Locate the nearest Mac dealer and order a battery

for a Performa 5300 / 5400 / 6200 / 6300 / 6400 / 630

These are the same and come complete with velcro.

Even the connector is the same.

I thought I mail this to the list , as I had trouble finding a

replacement battery , in spite of searching the mail archives.....

Jaap

